  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>Kind. Tired in a way that is not unhappy. He led the party up the stairs with a lantern and showed them the cots, and in the night he comes down the wrong stairwell with a tray.</p><p><strong>Room 1.</strong> He tells them it is not morning yet and they should go back to bed; the road will be there tomorrow. He knows one detail about one character that the character has never told anyone. If pressed about it he does not understand the question.</p><p><strong>Room 5.</strong> His voice from the common room below is the sound of ordinary morning.</p>",
